        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在生产阶段预置于阳光电源设备的阳光电源证书是阳光电源设备必备的出厂身份凭证，对其\n使用声明如下:",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        304.716,
        462.364,
        329.169
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-46C00A4E0F6A683B",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 4,
      "section_id": "SEC-C56E459A62C8E5F9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n阳光电源预置证书仅用于部署阶段为设备接入客户网络建立初始安全通道，阳光电源不对\n预置证书的安全性做承诺与保证。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        333.216,
        467.539,
        357.669
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-B775CA8B855D40B9",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 5,
      "section_id": "SEC-C56E459A62C8E5F9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n对于预置证书作为业务使用的场景，阳光电源不对其安全性做出承诺与保证，建议用户更\n换使用自己的安全证书。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        361.716,
        467.539,
        386.169
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-1F38C3E74276F886",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 6,
      "section_id": "SEC-C56E459A62C8E5F9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n阳光电源预置证书有效期为30 年。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        390.216,
        257.047,
        401.169
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-4EC00AD997F9F3D6",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 7,
      "section_id": "SEC-C56E459A62C8E5F9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n如果用户使用自己的证书，则需做好对证书生命周期的管理，为保证安全性推荐使用短有\n效期的证书。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        405.216,
        467.539,
        429.669
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-A549330D551DA3ED",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 8,
      "section_id": "SEC-C56E459A62C8E5F9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.1 预置证书风险声明",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n为保证安全性，建议用户每3 年更新一次证书。",
      "table_cells": null,
